WEBVTT

00:40:26.829 --> 00:40:30.413
big quotes was the gift you got
at the end of a long struggle?

00:40:30.413 --> 00:40:32.163
Do you think it was just luck?

00:40:32.496 --> 00:40:36.954
Tell me about how you view that sort of
moment in time where you come back

00:40:36.954 --> 00:40:38.413
and everything changes?

00:40:38.788 --> 00:40:41.288
Well, you know, I think it's it's
a combination of things, right?

00:40:41.288 --> 00:40:44.829
Like luck is always luck is always
a factor in everything.

00:40:45.204 --> 00:40:49.496
You know, how how do we ever know that
we're going to be standing there when

00:40:49.496 --> 00:40:54.121
that person walks up and you say hello and
then something that's born of that?

00:40:54.121 --> 00:40:56.871
Right. How I think of Brian's
life in my life

00:40:56.871 --> 00:40:59.246
and thinking about how how did
our paths ever get to cross?

00:40:59.246 --> 00:41:06.538
And and of course, a lot of it is that
by the time I met Brian, I was OK.